wer in terms of $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{2}\\sqrt{1-x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\int (1-u)^{2}\\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\int ({u}^{2}-2u+1)\\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\int ({u}^{5/2}-2{u}^{3/2}+{u}^{1/2})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-(\\frac{2}{7}{u}^{7/2}-\\frac{4}{5}{u}^{5/2}+\\frac{2}{3}{u}^{3/2})+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{7}}+\\frac{4}{5}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{5}}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{3}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535071 true] [17592186329708 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329709 13194139535071 true] [17592186329708 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329710 13194139535071 true] [17592186329708 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329711 13194139535071 true] [17592186329708 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329712 13194139535071 true] [17592186329708 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329713 13194139535071 true] [17592186329708 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535071 true] [17592186329708 1041 "selection" 13194139535071 true] [17592186329708 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329712 13194139535071 true] [17592186329708 1110 #uuid "160f67f9-8a32-5b64-8bb4-e000c3215b07" 13194139535071 true] [17592186329709 1034 "\\frac{2{x}^{2}}{7}-{x}^{2}+C" 13194139535071 true] [17592186329709 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535071 true] [17592186329709 1111 #uuid "19eb2c3b-8a97-576c-9a1b-28463c4850c8" 13194139535071 true] [17592186329710 1034 "\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt[5]{(1-x)^{7}}+\\frac{4}{5}\\sqrt[5]{(1-x)^{4}}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt[5]{(1-x)^{2}}+C" 13194139535071 true] [17592186329710 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535071 true] [17592186329710 1111 #uuid "b99fcf91-2a16-54f3-b0a2-824d77cd7949" 13194139535071 true] [17592186329711 1034 "-\\frac{2}{5}\\sqrt{{x}^{9}}+\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}-\\frac{5}{3}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}+C" 13194139535071 true] [17592186329711 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535071 true] [17592186329711 1111 #uuid "a72672e3-2c33-52f9-9a96-f26f68e7008d" 13194139535071 true] [17592186329712 1034 "-\\frac{2}{7}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{7}}+\\frac{4}{5}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{5}}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{(1-x)^{3}}+C" 13194139535